:none!important}</style></head><body><section li-section:on_templates="article" li-section="Article Body" class="section_article"><div class="padding-global article_padding"><div class="container-large article_inner"><header class="article_header"><div class="article_meta"><span li-object="article.tags.first">Company</span><span class="blog-meta_dot">·</span><span li-object="article.published_at | date: '%-d. %B %Y'">May 16, 2026</span></div><h1 li-object="article.title" class="article_title">Kith Treats & New Balance Grey Days 2026</h1><p li-object="article.excerpt" class="article_intro">In celebration of Grey Days, a month-long event championing New Balance’s signature Grey, Kith Treats is bringing back two limited-edition ice cream specials: The Grey State and The Greyscale.</p></header><figure class="article_hero"><img li-object:src="article.image | image_url: width: 2000" li-object:alt="article.image.alt" src="images/blog-apparel-1.svg" loading="eager" alt class="article_hero-img"></figure><div li-object="article.content" class="article_body text-rich-text w-richtext"><h2>Kith Treats & New Balance Grey Days 2026</h2><p>Martin Ehmele is a content creator, floral artist and fashion lover. Together with his dog Habibi, he lives in a 107-square-metre apartment in Vienna's Arsenal, a former 19th-century military complex. Vaulted ceilings nearly five metres high and thick walls define the architecture and give the rooms a distinctive sense of space.</p><p>Carefully chosen objects and plenty of greenery shape a home that feels deeply personal — and deliberately sets itself apart from classic trend interiors.</p><blockquote>"From childhood on, fashion has always been my armour and protective shell to the outside world, a way to turn my inner self outward and simply have fun with aesthetics."</blockquote><p>Martin Ehmele is a content creator, floral artist and fashion lover. Together with his dog Habibi, he lives in a 107-square-metre apartment in Vienna's Arsenal, a fo